8	 *
9	 * Top-level kernel orchestrator for Grouped Matmul Slice-K Per-Token Dequant.
10	 * AIC (Cube):  int8 matmul → workspace (int32)
11	 * AIV (Vector): workspace → Cast(int32→fp32) → Mul(scale[N]) → per-row Muls(pt_scale[i]) → Cast(fp32→bf16) → output
12	 */
